Future Improvements
Add sound effects for dice rolls, ladders, and snakes.
Animated movement of the player tokens.
Support for more than two players.
Persist game history to a file.
Mobile‑friendly layout adjustments.
Enjoy playing and feel free to tweak the code – it’s written to be easy to understand for beginners!
